v4.8.dev5 - Fedora Linux 44 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors (1920x1080 @ 164.83 Hz, 1920x1080 @ 59.96 Hz) - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 9060 XT (RADV GFX1200) - AMD Ryzen 7 5700X 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 31.24 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen Triplanar is enabled in a StandardMaterial3D that uses streamed textures, only the lowest allowed LOD is loaded.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open MRP (Inactivity Decay Rate is set to 100ms to speed up the bug showcase)\n2. Open `node_3d.tscn`\n3. Focus on the MeshInstance3D and zoom in to see the bug better\n4. Optionally increase Max LOD in the Textures menu for a more dramatic effect\n5. Select `polyhaven_brick_pavement_03/brick_pavement_03.tres`\n6. Enable UV1/Triplanar\n7. Move the mouse around a bit to redraw the editor\n8. Texture quality will decrease to the lowest possible\n9. Disable UV1/Triplanar\n10. Texture quality will get back to normal\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[texture_streaming_triplanar_mrp_2026-09-11_20-07-43.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32124892/texture_streaming_triplanar_mrp_2026-09-11_20-07-43.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.gi